      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head>Wer 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Siððan man mot mid lufe ofgan, gif man hwile fulle freondrædne habban.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Afterwards, one may depart with love, if one wish to have full friendship.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Syððan man mot mid lufe ofgan, gif man wille fulle freondræddene habban.</ab>
